  "problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x?$ Assume that $n$ is an integer. \n\nI. The function intersects the $x$-axis at $x=n\\pi .$\n\nII. The function has minimum values at $x=-\\frac{\\pi }{2}+n\\pi .$\n\nIII. The range of the function is $y\\in [-2\\pi ,2\\pi ].$",
